idence.url}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Try / set up this tool ↗</a></div>`).join('')}</section>${list.length>1?`<section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span class="step-circle">↔</span><div><h2>How the tools work together.</h2><p>You stay in control of each handoff.</p></div></div>${list.slice(0,-1).map((t,i)=>{const h=handoff(t,list[i+1]);return `<div class="handoff"><div><b>${esc(h.from)}</b><span aria-hidden="true"> → </span><b>${esc(h.to)}</b>${pill(h.kind,'amber')}</div><p><b>Information passed:</b> ${esc(h.information)}</p><p><b>Your step:</b> ${esc(h.owner)}</p><small>${esc(h.note)}</small></div>`;}).join('')}</section>`:''}<section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span class="day-badge">DAYS 2–6</span><div><h2>Try one real, manageable task.</h2><p>${esc(taskArtifact())}</p></div></div>${check('prepare','Prepare one useful draft or a small test set.',state.profile.description?'Use your details: '+state.profile.description:'Use your actual offer, services or approved business facts.')}${check('review','Review the output before a customer sees it.','Check facts, prices, dates and any personal information.')}${check('measure','Record the result each day.','Use your spreadsheet, a note or your calendar. Capture time spent, errors and the success metric below.')}<label class="field metric-field" for="success-metric"><span>Your one measurable success metric</span><textarea id="success-metric" rows="3" maxlength="1200">${esc(metric())}</textarea><small>Adjust the target to your situation. This carries into your exported plan and coach review.</small></label></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><span class="day-badge">DAY 7</span><div><h2>Keep, adjust or stop.</h2><p>Compare your result with the success metric. Check actual cost and time before deciding.</p></div></div>${list.map(t=>`<div class="decision-tool"><h3>${esc(t.name)}</h3><label class="tried-check"><input type="checkbox" data-tried="${t.id}" ${['tr